+    /// Exclusive loads and stores (LDREX, STREX and their sizes) inline through the page table, as
+    /// fastmem_exclusive_access does through fastmem, instead of a call into the global monitor and
+    /// the callbacks each. With Unsafe_IgnoreGlobalMonitor, without the monitor's lock as well. An
